    <!-- Real, observed UX gap: the single static "Thinking…" bubble
         above sat there unchanged for the whole wait, including a
         30+ second image-generation call - with nothing to show it
         was progressing, users assumed the app had frozen and tapped
         send again, colliding with the still-in-flight request's
         idempotency key. AiConversationPage now cycles through these
         as elapsed time grows, so the assistant keeps narrating what
         it's doing exactly like a normal AI chat, instead of one
         frozen-looking label for the whole wait. -->
